description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests summarizing a user-provided URL
  or pasted threat report, extracting its IOCs, enriching the findings, and comparing
  the report against XTI/Cortex context (treating external claims as unverified reference).
  Examples: "analyze this threat report", "summarize this URL and pull its IOCs",
  "check the indicators in this blog against our XTI context". Do not activate for
  autonomous web search, third-party feed lookup, or case-only triage, ticketing,
  messaging, and write actions.'
